      Focal Shape Size: 0.05000000074505806
      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 0.13000020384788513
      Target Frame: uav_base_link
      Yaw: 2.540001630783081
